Subject: [PATCH] Match the Bazel module version to the landed source commit

Origin: SONiC registry registration for securely1g/sonic-dbsyncd.
Source: https://github.com/securely1g/sonic-dbsyncd/commit/8a3830704d3f6067823f7c10b3b31913965add81

Bazel requires the fetched module version to match its registry version.
Append the landed source commit to the module's base version; leave the
sonic-d wheel version and all build and runtime behavior unchanged.

--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 module(
     name = "sonic-dbsyncd",
-    version = "2.0.0",
+    version = "2.0.0-8a3830704d3f6067823f7c10b3b31913965add81",
     bazel_compatibility = [
         ">=8.5.1",
         "<=8.5.1",
